<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>

<title>
Geometry Workspace
</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">

</head>


<body>


<header>

<nav class="navbar">

<div class="logo">
Math<span>Master</span>
</div>


<div class="nav-links">

<a href="/teacher/math-tools">
Math Tools
</a>

<a href="/logout">
Logout
</a>

</div>

</nav>

</header>



<main class="dashboard">


<div class="dashboard-header">

<h1>
📐 Geometry Workspace
</h1>

<p>
Interactive construction tools for mathematics lessons.
</p>

</div>



<div class="dashboard-card">


<h2>
⭕ Circle Tool
</h2>

<p>
Enter a radius and draw a circle.
</p>


<label>
Radius:
</label>


<input 
type="number"
id="radius"
value="50"
min="10"
max="200"
>



<button 
onclick="drawCircle()"
class="btn primary">

Draw Circle

</button>


<button 
onclick="clearCanvas()"
class="btn">

Clear

</button>

<button
onclick="drawGrid()"
class="btn primary">

📊 Draw Coordinate Grid

</button>

<div class="dashboard-card">

<h2>
🧭 Compass Tool
</h2>


<p>
Draw circles by dragging the centre and radius.
</p>


<button
onclick="activeTool='compass'; drawCompass()"
class="btn primary">

Draw Compass

</button>


<p id="compassResult">

Radius:

</p>


</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">

<h2>
📍 Point Plotter
</h2>


<p>
Plot a point on the coordinate grid.
</p>


<label>
X Coordinate:
</label>


<input
type="number"
id="pointX"
value="3"
>


<br><br>


<label>
Y Coordinate:
</label>


<input
type="number"
id="pointY"
value="2"
>


<br><br>


<label>
Label:
</label>


<input
type="text"
id="pointLabel"
value="A"
>


<br><br>


<button
onclick="activeTool='point'; triangleActive=false; plotPoint()"
class="btn primary">

📍 Plot Point

</button>


<p id="pointResult">

Point:

</p>


</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">

<h2>
📍 Midpoint Tool
</h2>

<p>
Find the midpoint between two selected points.
</p>

<button
onclick="activeTool='midpoint'; startMidpointTool()"
class="btn primary">

Find Midpoint

</button>

<p id="midpointResult">

No midpoint selected.

</p>

</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">

<h2>
📏 Line Segment Tool
</h2>

<p>
Draw a line segment between two selected points.
</p>

<button
onclick="activeTool='segment'; startSegmentTool()"
class="btn primary">

Draw Segment

</button>

<p id="segmentResult">

No segment drawn.

</p>

</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">

<h2>
↔ Parallel Line Tool
</h2>

<p>
Draw a line parallel to a reference segment.
</p>

<button
onclick="activeTool='parallel'; startParallelTool()"
class="btn primary">

Draw Parallel Line

</button>

<p id="parallelResult">

No parallel line drawn.

</p>

</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">

<h2>
⟂ Perpendicular Line Tool
</h2>

<p>
Draw a line perpendicular to a reference line.
</p>

<button
onclick="selectGeometryTool('perpendicular'); startPerpendicularTool()"
class="btn primary">

Draw Perpendicular Line

</button>

<p id="perpendicularResult">

No perpendicular line drawn.

</p>

</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">

<h2>
📐 Perpendicular Bisector Tool
</h2>

<p>
Find the midpoint of a segment and draw its perpendicular bisector.
</p>

<button
onclick="activeTool='bisector'; startBisectorTool()"
class="btn primary">

Draw Perpendicular Bisector

</button>

<p id="bisectorResult">

No bisector drawn.

</p>

</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">

<h2>
📐 Angle Bisector Tool
</h2>

<p>
Divide an angle into two equal parts.
</p>

<button
onclick="activeTool='angleBisector'; startAngleBisectorTool()"
class="btn primary">

Draw Angle Bisector

</button>

<p id="angleBisectorResult">

No angle bisector drawn.

</p>

</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">

<h2>
🔺 Polygon Builder
</h2>

<p>
Create polygons by selecting multiple vertices.
</p>

<button
onclick="activeTool='polygon'; startPolygonTool()"
class="btn primary">

Start Polygon

</button>

<button
onclick="finishPolygon()"
class="btn secondary">

Finish Polygon

</button>

<p id="polygonResult">

No polygon created.

</p>

</div>

<button onclick="undo()">
    ↩ Undo
</button>

<button onclick="redo()">
    ↪ Redo
</button>

<br><br>


<canvas
id="geometryCanvas"
width="500"
height="400"
style="border:1px solid black;">
</canvas>


</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">


<h2>
🔄 Reflection Tool
</h2>


<p>
Reflect a point across the coordinate axes.
</p>


<label>
X Coordinate:
</label>

<input
type="number"
id="reflectX"
value="3"
>


<br><br>


<label>
Y Coordinate:
</label>

<input
type="number"
id="reflectY"
value="2"
>


<br><br>


<button
onclick="reflectXaxis()"
class="btn primary">

Reflect X-Axis

</button>


<button
onclick="reflectYaxis()"
class="btn primary">

Reflect Y-Axis

</button>


<p id="reflectionResult">

Reflection:

</p>


</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">

<h2>
➡️ Translation Tool
</h2>

<p>
Translate a point by a given horizontal and vertical distance.
</p>

<label>X Translation (Δx):</label>

<input
type="number"
id="translateX"
value="2"
>

<br><br>

<label>Y Translation (Δy):</label>

<input
type="number"
id="translateY"
value="2"
>

<br><br>

<button
onclick="translatePoint()"
class="btn primary">

Translate Point

</button>

<p id="translationResult">

Translation:

</p>

</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">

<h2>
🔄 Rotation Tool
</h2>

<p>
Rotate the last plotted point about the origin.
</p>

<label>
Rotation Angle (°):
</label>

<input
type="number"
id="rotationAngle"
value="90"
>

<br><br>

<button
onclick="rotatePoint()"
class="btn primary">

Rotate Point

</button>

<p id="rotationResult">

Rotation:

</p>

</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">


<h2>
📏 Ruler Tool
</h2>


<p>
Measure the distance between two points.
</p>


<button
onclick="activeTool='ruler'; drawRuler()"
class="btn primary">

Draw Ruler

</button>


<p id="distanceResult">

Distance:

</p>


</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">


<h2>
📐 Protractor Tool
</h2>


<p>
Measure angles between two lines.
</p>


<button
onclick="activeTool='angle'; drawAngle()"
class="btn primary">

Create Angle

</button>


<p id="angleResult">

Angle:

</p>


</div>

<div class="dashboard-card">


<h2>
🔺 Triangle Constructor
</h2>


<p>
Create and analyse a triangle.
</p>


<button
onclick="activeTool='triangle'; triangleActive=true; saveHistory(); drawTriangle()"
class="btn primary">

Create Triangle

</button>


<p id="triangleResult">

Triangle Information:

</p>


</div>

</main>



<script src="/js/geometry-tools.js"></script>


</body>

</html>